  "statement": "Let $\\mathbf{a}=(2,-1,3)$ and $\\mathbf{b}=(1,2,-1)$. (i) Find $\\mathbf{a}\\cdot\\mathbf{b}$. (ii) Find the angle between them. (iii) Find the vector projection of $\\mathbf{a}$ onto $\\mathbf{b}$.",
  "solution": "(i) $\\mathbf{a}\\cdot\\mathbf{b}=2(1)+(-1)(2)+3(-1)=-3$. (ii) $|\\mathbf{a}|=\\sqrt{14}$, $|\\mathbf{b}|=\\sqrt{6}$; $\\cos\\theta=\\frac{-3}{\\sqrt{84}}=-\\frac{3}{2\\sqrt{21}}$, so $\\theta=\\arccos\\!\\left(-\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{84}}\\right)$. (iii) $\\operatorname{proj}_{\\mathbf{b}}\\mathbf{a}=\\frac{\\mathbf{a}\\cdot\\mathbf{b}}{|\\mathbf{b}|^{2}}\\mathbf{b}=\\frac{-3}{6}(1,2,-1)=(-\\tfrac12,-1,\\tfrac12)$.",
